  "_about": "Competitive Call of Duty profiles, built from itzBuddy's own optimized config files (Warzone/Black Ops 7 = cod25, Modern Warfare 4 beta = cod26). Keys are Name@index; the hash part after ';' changes between game updates, so it is ignored. Only keys that already exist in the user's file are changed, and every value is checked against the range or option list the game writes next to it. Monitor, resolution, refresh rate, window, audio devices, sensitivity and driver keys are never touched. GPU-vendor keys (Reflex, Anti-Lag 2, upscaler) and RendererWorkerCount are set at run time.",
